Package: umi-sensors
Source: xiaomi-umi-bsp
Version: 1.0-umi3
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Zhao_Wang
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.36), systemd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Xiaomi Mi 10 (umi) SLPI sensor userspace (one-shot package)
 hexagonrpcd-umi (linux-msm/hexagonrpc @93f3467 + apollo-sensor-fixes:
 rooted HexagonFS -R, PD fixes) serving the SLPI sensor PD over
 /dev/fastrpc-sdsp, plus the sensor registry tree (HexagonFS root),
 systemd units + umi drop-ins, accelerometer mount-matrix udev rule and
 fastrpc modules-load glue.
 .
 Mirrors the sensor BSP hooks in config/boards/xiaomi-umi.conf, packaged
 so an already-built trixie rootfs can be brought up by installing this
 one deb after the 7.2.11-Sa2de-D0000-Pb69e (or newer) kernel/dtb.
 Requires the kernel to have SLPI enabled (sm8250-xiaomi-umi.dtb).
